              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Synopsis of Dialog] Briefly introduce the Spices Supreme's reviews and the history of Aurum Alley."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Aurum Alley is the place most steeped in everyday life aboard the Luofu.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"I've wanted to check out this store for ages and finally come with a friend.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Duration] 5 seconds"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Music/SFX] Boom mic, SFX sounds for opening titles"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4a897e8b9d59bacf"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Scene] Spices Supreme interior"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
