              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Synopsis of Dialog] Explain the flavor of signature dishes, focusing on orders being personal preference."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"The signature dish at Spices Supreme is their Granny Chen's Tofu. That soft slimy tofu goes down a treat.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"The boss slices the pork belly fresh to order, and one mouthful is enough to make you cry. You don't want to miss out on this bestseller!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
