          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Title Selection]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Blitz Aurum Alley with your besties! And find that flavor that makes her weep"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Where's the universally renowned Granny Chen's Tofu? Join our 1-day tour of Aurum Alley!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Gorge down 18 meals til you get stomach can't take it — and you'll still want more..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Delicacies only available in Aurum Alley! Are meatballs really still made by hand?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Lose yourself in 5 minutes flat in the mouth-watering paradise of Aurum Alley..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-94f02e451f314f1e"
